		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>From April we open <strong>an hour earlier</strong>, so the first loaves are on the shelf at seven. See the <a href="https://oldmill.example/about/">about page</a>.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2>When we bake</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:list -->
<ul><li>Sourdough every morning</li><li>Rye on <em>Thursdays</em></li></ul>
<!-- /wp:list -->

<!-- wp:image -->
<figure class="wp-block-image"><img src="https://oldmill.example/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/loaf-1024x683.jpg" alt="A loaf cooling by the window" class="wp-image-30"/><figcaption>The first loaf of the day</figcaption></figure>
<!-- /wp:image -->

<p>[order_form id="7"]</p>

<blockquote><p>The best rye in the valley.</p></blockquote>
<script>document.write("never")</script>
<p onclick="steal()">Come early.</p>]]></content:encoded>
